 Asserting [.monospaced]#++I_RESETN++# returns the configuration registers to the same reset values as [.monospaced]#++AOU_SW_RESET++#, and on [.monospaced]#++AOU_TOP++# it also returns the FDI bringup controller to Reset (xref:{aou-integration-xref}#aou-ig-reset-domains[Reset domains]).
